      "writtenOn": "2024-03-04T21:56:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "How about putting the recursive mutex logic into `core/cortex-m/task.c` with the other mutex functions and just wrap them here like you did with others?\n\nThen we can also write a basic unit test for those recursive lock functions.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 196,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 200,
        "endChar": 2
      },
      "revId": "a5d4b76b41eba7d6e3671f4f338a2279fc35424c",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
